Simplified-to-Traditional Chinese conversion is available only as an optional
compatibility flag during dictionary build. Simplified Chinese is the default.
The converter is not redistributed and is not required at runtime.

  OpenCC / opencc-python-reimplemented
  https://github.com/BYVoid/OpenCC
  Apache License 2.0

Runtime dependencies, installed from PyPI by the user:

  winsdk    - Python projection of the Windows Runtime APIs (Windows.Media.Ocr)
  pywin32   - Python for Windows Extensions (SAPI speech synthesis)


Optional online service
-----------------------

Oxford Dictionaries API
https://developer.oxforddictionaries.com/

Oxford content is not bundled, cached in this repository, or redistributed by
this project. Users who enable the optional provider supply their own App ID
and App Key and are responsible for complying with the Oxford API terms for
their account. Runtime requests send only the normalized lookup word to the
official Oxford endpoint. Credentials are transmitted as HTTPS request headers
and are not written to the source tree or vocabulary database.

Everything else in this repository is original work covered by the MIT License
in the LICENSE file.
